Key Features of ArgoCD: 

1️Automatic Deployment

	Changes in Git automatically deploy to Kubernetes.

2️Rollback Support

	Rollback using Git:

		git revert commit

	ArgoCD syncs cluster to the previous version.

3️Drift Detection

	If someone manually changes the cluster:

		kubectl edit deployment

	ArgoCD detects the drift and restores the original state.

4️Visual Dashboard

	ArgoCD provides a UI showing:

Applications

Cluster state

Deployment status

Health status

Sync status

5️Multi Cluster Deployment

ArgoCD can deploy to:

Dev cluster
Stage cluster
Production cluster

